      "source_advisory": {
        "id": "AA23-353A",
        "title": "#StopRansomware: ALPHV Blackcat (FBI/CISA/HHS, updated 2024-02-27)",
        "url": "https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/cybersecurity-advisories/aa23-353a"
      },
      "advisory_healthcare_notes": [
        "Since mid-December 2023, of the nearly 70 leaked victims, the healthcare sector has been the most commonly victimized.",
        "Likely in response to the ALPHV Blackcat administrator's post encouraging affiliates to target hospitals after operational action against the group in early December 2023."
      ],
      "playbook_scenario_assumptions": [
        "Ransom notes specifically reference HIPAA and OCR breach notification requirements",
        "Threatens to publish patient names, medications, and insurance IDs on leak site",
        "Targets pharmacy POS systems for credit card + PHI dual theft",
        "Uses Windows TrustedInstaller privileges to disable Microsoft Defender"
      ]
